Developer notes (not installed): the dialogs are GENERATED. Edit dlg/nwsaom_dialog_spec.py (parses the syntax lines of the ado files and docs/SAOM_EFFECTS_INVENTORY.csv), run `python3 dlg/gen_dialogs.py` to rewrite the .dlg files in the repository root; never edit a .dlg by hand.
Then run `python3 dlg/check_dialogs.py` (static checks), `NWCORE=... dlg/db_load_check.sh` (every dialog must return rc 0 from `db`) and `NWCORE=... python3 dlg/smoke_test.py` (runs the command each entry builds in Stata -e; dlg/smoke_results.csv).
Stata rules the generator obeys: one row of tabs (at most 9 tabs, titles at most 10 characters, 90 px per tab), size at most 1100x600, SYNCHRONOUS_ONLY, no PROGRAM longer than ~100 lines (option code is split into sub-programs called with `put /program`).
